  "missionPointsLabel": "Pioneer Badges",
  "tips": [
    "The 4 airdrop items are Destroyer Rocket, Frost Bomb, Battlefield MedKit, and Smoke Bomb. You can collect only one crate at a time.",
    "Points come from buildings, gathering supply crates, and airdrops.",
    "Healing uses the Battlefield MedKit and costs no resources. Your troops heal when you leave.",
    "You cannot loot resources from a chief you beat. Cities burn faster, and a city that fails is moved to a random place.",
    "President, Frost Dragon Tyrant, and territory bonuses and Pet Gathering Skills do not apply. 10% and 20% buffs and battle pet bonuses do.",
    "If you quit an event session you cannot re-enter it.",
    "The Icebreaker Shop uses Pioneer Badges. Some items need the Fire Crystal Age. Each mission also gives Pioneer Badges.",
    "Matchmaking times in the game screen are shown in your local time."
